[statement]
A dependency cycle is broken where it closes: the walk from `b` reaches
the other package, whose dependency on `b`, already being walked, is
passed over, so the other package is installed first.

[repository]
P:a
V:1
D:b

P:b
V:1
D:a

[request]
b

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install a 1
install b 1
